OL,3,GNEWSAEx American football pro supports
OL,4,Astroke research
OL,5,
OL,6,FHart said it was a "scary time" and has
OL,7,Fsince joined the National Young Stroke
OL,8,FStudy to help raise awareness the
OL,9,Fcondition can also affect people under
OL,10,Fthe age of 55.
